# Deliverable Manifest — {PROJECT_TITLE}

Formal deliverables live under `deliverables/` and retain stable `DEL-*` IDs.
Generated working material belongs in `output/` and is not automatically a
deliverable.

| ID | Deliverable | Consumer | Requirement links | Verification | State | Handoff |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

A deliverable cannot become `verified` or `accepted` without at least one
requirement relation and a passed `VER-*` relation.
